__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Per-frame crops, and the edited PDFs tools/stroke_probe.py writes for each measurement. Both
# are regenerated deterministically from the committed PDFs, and together they are about two
# thirds of this repository's bulk. The measurements taken from them are kept: they live in the
# .probe.md and .probe.json tables beside these folders, not inside them.
tests/**/crops/
tests/**/probe/
# Mutable working copy of the fixture; the pristine copy is the record.
tests/indesign-stroke/corpus/working/
# Python environment for the tools; requirements.txt is the record. Its pyvenv.cfg holds
# absolute paths naming this machine's user.
.venv/
# Plugin build output: logs, object files, program databases, and the built plugin. The build
# logs record absolute paths naming this machine's user, and everything here is regenerated by
# plugin/build-plugin.ps1.
build/
# Edited PDFs written by the measurement scripts, alongside the probe's own; regenerate them.
tests/indesign-stroke/corpus/actual/normprobe/
tests/indesign-stroke/corpus/actual/covprobe/
# EPS and PostScript written by the export and print measurements. InDesign stamps a "%%For:"
# line naming this machine's user into the DSC header of both, which tools/scan_identifiable.py
# reports, and it cannot be edited out without rewriting the DOS EPS section offsets that follow
# it. Regenerate with tools/jsx/ise-reexport.jsx and tools/jsx/ise-print-ps.jsx; the
# measurements taken from them are recorded in the fixture's NOTES.md.
tests/**/*.eps
tests/**/*.ps
